# Cursor AI Rules
Before modifying or creating any code in this repository:
1. Read and strictly follow `AGENTS.md`.
2. Do NOT edit root `.html` files (`index.html`, `pong.html`, `spacewar.html`) directly.
3. Always make modifications inside `src/`.
4. Run `node src/test.mjs` and `node src/build.mjs` before committing.
